From 4f06deae79de38ca7caea3eef4d073960aac7c6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Captain Polliwog build <build@captainpolliwog.invalid>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:16:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 38/42] More JavaScript: lookbehind, dotAll, static blocks,
 numeric separators, import maps

- Regular expression lookbehind, (?<=...) and (?<!...): the body is
  compiled on its own, anchored at its end, and tried backwards from
  each position. Captures inside it keep their numbers but never
  capture. Patterns with lookbehind skip the PowerPC regex JIT.
- The s (dotAll) flag; Unicode emoji properties for \p{...}, newer than
  the bundled ICU (tables from Unicode 17); identifiers by ID_Start and
  ID_Continue, including characters beyond the BMP.
- Class static blocks; numeric separators (1_000).
- Import maps (<script type="importmap">, "imports" only), which
  GitHub loads React through.
